        PortModels: []
        Text: "# Game StateMachine\nManages high level game flow and level transitions.\n\n##
          Features\n- Emulates a state machine `OnStateEnter/Exit`.\r\n- Uses RunSubgraph
          (Static) to execute `B_Load_Level` and \n`B_Unload_Level` with different
          parameters."
